   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Sites live on a separate domain, never takshacodespace.in, and get no Taksha cookies.\nThe edge reads only Redis + S3, so sites stay up when the control plane is down.\nEach build runs isolated in the builds namespace with upload creds for its own prefix.",
   "originalText": "Sites live on a separate domain, never takshacodespace.in, and get no Taksha cookies.\nThe edge reads only Redis + S3, so sites stay up when the control plane is down.\nEach build runs isolated in the builds namespace with upload creds for its own prefix.",
